OL,3,GNEWSAVenue that hosted Blur to be
OL,4,Ademolished for revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was a nightclub that once attracted
OL,7,Fbands like Blur, Pink Floyd and Cream,
OL,8,Fbut it could soon play host to more
OL,9,Fsedate and family-friendly activities.
OL,11,FGreat Yarmouth Borough Council has
OL,12,Ffinally agreed the sale of the Ocean
OL,13,FRoom in Gorleston, Norfolk, after a
OL,14,Fyear of negotiations.
OL,16,FIt has been bought for #500,000 by
OL,17,FOcean Pavilion, a subsidiary of Bespoke
OL,18,FConstruction Group, which hopes to
OL,19,Fusher in a "new chapter" for the site.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
